_work/
# Only the release-standard runs (1 and 4 tasks, plain or -batch) are versioned.
# Ad-hoc runs (other task counts, ablations, experiments) stay local.
*.json
!*-t1.json
!*-t4.json
!*-t1-batch.json
!*-t4-batch.json
# Archived runs (non-standard, repeated or failed runs kept as evidence) live under runs/.
!runs/**/*.json
